 "posts": [
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: NOVEMBER 12, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa NOVEMBER 12, 2026 (Thursday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: November 12, 2026 (Thursday)\nReason: Reconductoring of 5 span dilapidated secondary lines into 4/0 All aluminum conductors.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n8:00AM to 5:00PM\nPortion of AF8 -  Portion along B11, L14, Torrecampo Village, Brgy. Cabug, Bacolod City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
